     `.jw-*` component — lives in `admin.css`, because script-built DOM carries
     no `data-astro-cid` and a scoped rule would silently match nothing. */
  .jw-head { align-items: flex-start; }
  .jw-id { min-width: 0; }
  .jw-head-right { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-end; gap: var(--space-2); }
  .jw-message { min-height: 18px; font-size: 12px; margin: 0 0 var(--space-3); }
  /* No message, no band: an empty paragraph was adding a line of paper between
     the header actions and the status chips. */
  .jw-message:empty { min-height: 0; margin: 0; }
  .jw-message[data-tone='error'] { color: var(--color-accent-700); }
</style>
